    "updated_at": "2018-03-15T07:52:56Z",
    "body": "FWIW, 2 and possibly 3 depending the specifics seem rather complicated and probably not something that's really worth the investment required. I kinda think the same goes for 1, especially as currently user agents are not required to log parse errors at all, so that would just make them slower.",
