    "updated_at": "2018-03-15T10:12:18Z",
    "body": "What's interesting about this proposal is that it could be entirely implemented on the server side. As such, I'd expect us to want to see a popular server-side library/middleware/etc. that implements this, and becomes in wide use. That would help prove the concept ahead of any discussions of standardizing it or adding code to browsers.",
