    "created_at": "2018-03-15T11:01:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-03-15T11:01:51Z",
    "body": "I understand the idea, but I think that to show this is worth investing implementation resources in, you'd be well-served by first showing that it's valuable enough to web developers that they'd invest server resources in it.\r\n\r\nExisting validators are indeed useful, but are already serving their purpose (ahead of time validation) very well. What you're proposing is something new, and its usefulness hasn't really been shown in the market yet.",
